          "quote": "把彩超报告给医生，问：“这个增宽具体是多少毫米？属于轻度、中度还是明显增宽？”"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00306",
          "explanation": "Doctor verifies the family’s reported ‘12mm, 10mm’ measurements, places them in the mild‑width category, and avoids treating the report as a definitive prognosis.",
          "quote": "侧脑室宽度 ≥10mm 属于“增宽”，10-15mm 这个范围叫“轻度增宽”"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor verifies the ambiguous ‘脑积水’ report by asking for the specific millimetre measurements, classifying them as mild enlargement, and explicitly separating screening from diagnosis.",
