          "explanation": "Doctor suggests using the phone or app to check for high‑risk clinic slots and consolidates the medication, report, and follow‑up into one visit.",
          "quote": "如果高危产科医生认为胎儿脑室增宽需要更专业的产前诊断评估，他们会帮你转诊或会诊胎儿医学/产前诊断科，不需要你们自己判断。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly addresses the family’s real‑world constraint of wanting to minimize trips by designing a consolidated visit plan that combines medication refill, TSH blood draw, and specialist review, with clear instructions on what to bring.",
